01:06:36,000 --> 01:06:42,000
The Electrical Life of Louis Wain is a 2021 biographical comedy-drama film directed by Will
Sharpe, from a story by Simon Stephenson, and screenplay by Stephenson and Sharpe.

10
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:06,000
The film stars Benedict Cumberbatch (as the eccentric artist Louis
Wain), Claire Foy, Andrea Riseborough and Toby Jones.

11
01:21:24,000 --> 01:21:30,000
The Electrical Life of Louis Wain had its world premiere at the 48th Telluride Film Festival on 2 September 2021,  had a
limited release on 22 October 2021, and was released in the United States on Prime Video on 5 November 2021.

12
01:28:48,000 --> 01:28:54,000
It was released in the United Kingdom on 1 January 2022, by StudioCanal.

13
